#. Tag: title
#: toc.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "Table of Contents"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: primary
#: toc.docbook:12 toc.docbook:21 toc.docbook:33 toc.docbook:34 toc.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "table of contents"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: secondary
#: toc.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "introduction"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: toc.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When writing a large document, it is useful to include a table of contents. "
"This can be done automatically with &kword;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: toc.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To begin creating a table of contents &kword; needs to know what to include "
"in the table of contents. The first part of this chapter describes how to "
"prepare the document to generate an accurate table of contents."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: toc.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The second part of this section, discusses the actual generation and "
"updating of the table of contents."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: toc.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The final part of this section provides pointers on changing the look of the "
"table of contents."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: toc.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "Preparing the document"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: secondary
#: toc.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid "preparing document for"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: toc.docbook:23
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kword; uses a style-based method of creating table of contents entries."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: toc.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For more information on styles, see the <link linkend=\"styles\">Styles</"
"link> section of this documentation."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: toc.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To mark each level of the document, use the paragraph styles <guilabel>Head "
"1</guilabel>, <guilabel>Head 2</guilabel> and <guilabel>Head 3</guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: toc.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "Major subjects should be marked with the <guilabel>Head 1</guilabel> style."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: toc.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sub-headings under the <guilabel>Head 1</guilabel> subjects should be marked "
"with <guilabel>Head 2</guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: toc.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sub-headings under the <guilabel>Head 2</guilabel> subject headings should "
"be marked with <guilabel>Head 3</guilabel>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: toc.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Once this is done, proceed to the next section."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: toc.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating the table of contents"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: secondary
#: toc.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "creating"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: secondary
#: toc.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "updating"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: toc.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create the table of contents is easy. Simply place the cursor in a text "
"frame where the table of contents should be inserted."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: toc.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select <menuchoice> <guimenu>Insert</guimenu><guimenuitem>Table of Contents</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: toc.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kword; locates all entries labeled with the appropriate paragraph styles, "
"and their corresponding page numbers. It assembles this into the table of "
"contents."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: toc.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once the table of contents is created, it will remain unchanged until "
"&kword; is instructed to update it."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: toc.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To update the table of contents, click once with the &LMB; in the current "
"table of contents. Then select <menuchoice> <guimenu>Insert</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Update Table of Contents</guimenuitem></menuchoice> "
"from the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: toc.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kword; will replace the old table of contents with a newly updated one."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: toc.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "Changing the look of the table of contents."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: secondary
#: toc.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "formatting"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: toc.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The look of the table of contents is also adjusted by using the paragraph "
"styles in &kword;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: toc.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The table of contents title is formated with the <guilabel>Contents Title</"
"guilabel> paragraph style. All major subject headings (those marked with the "
"<guilabel>Head 1</guilabel> style), are now formatted using "
"<guilabel>Contents Head 1</guilabel> paragraph style. All sub-headings "
"(those marked with the <guilabel>Head 2</guilabel> style), are now formatted "
"using <guilabel>Contents Head 2</guilabel> paragraph style. Finally, all sub-"
"headings (those marked with the <guilabel>Head 3</guilabel> style), are now "
"formatted using <guilabel>Contents Head 3</guilabel> paragraph style."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: toc.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By <link linkend=\"style-edit\">changing the look</link> of those three "
"styles, the appearance of the table of contents can be radically changed."
msgstr ""

